[version]
1.5.1
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: GUI now launches FIRST, no text login!
  - Built-in graphical login screen (no text mode at all)
  - Login window with User/Pass fields, Tab to switch, Enter to login
  - Desktop appears immediately after successful login
- FIXED: Window borders now VISIBLE!
  - window.create() uses inner coords (offset by border)
  - Chrome (borders, title bar, buttons) drawn ON TOP of content
  - Each window has unique colored border (8 colors cycle)
- FIXED: Keyboard events (Enter, etc.) now delivered to windows!
  - Key/char/paste events go to active window via resumeKey()
  - Apps inside windows can now receive Enter, Backspace, etc.
  - Terminal, editor, and other apps now work properly in windows
- IMPROVED: Mouse events properly translated to window coordinates
  - resumeMouse() converts screen coords to window-relative
  - Clicks only delivered if inside inner content area
  - Mouse scroll/up/drag all handled
[/whatsnew]
